The key insight is in `format_skip`:
```c
const char *
format_skip(const char *s, const char *end)
{
        int     brackets = 0;

        for (; *s != '\0'; s++) {
                if (*s == '#' && s[1] == '{')
                        brackets++;
                if (*s == '#' &&
                    s[1] != '\0' &&
                    strchr(",#{}:", s[1]) != NULL) {
                        s++;
                        continue;
